      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Progress as of Q2: 

As the implementation just started as we recently received the WB&#x2019;s clearance of ESF (Environment and Social Framework). However, we&#x2019;ve completed several deliverables including:c and LOAs with SFD, SMEPs and PWP.
-	Project Operational Manual
-	ESF including: Environmental and Social Management Framework, Stakeholder Engagement Plan, Environmental and Social Commitment Plan, Gender Action Plan, Labor Management Plan, and Environmental and Social Management System of SMEs.

Progress as Q3:
there is still some delay due to lengthy process of preparing and clearing ESMPs, but the preparatory works including field assessments and project designs are all on track. Key deliverables achieved include:
- In total 110 districts are selected and 182 subprojects costing USD 11,812,000 ranging from 1-6 subprojects and an average cost per subproject of USD 65,000.
- So far 2 tenders have been announced for a total of USD 8.57 million (tender 1 49 subprojects at estimated cost of USD 3.766 million and tender 2, 70 subprojects at estimated cost of USD 4.878 million.</narrative>
